  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under IRC Section 7701(a)(36), a tax return preparer is any person who prepares for compensation a substantial portion of a return. Taylor determined the tax treatment of a complex revenue recognition transaction, which constitutes a substantial portion of the return.
